OL,3,GNEWSAEljamel: Rogue surgeon 'undertook
OL,4,Aunnecessary operation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisgraced surgeon Sam Eljamel performed
OL,7,Fan unnecessary spinal operation after
OL,8,F"seriously misinterpreting" an MRI
OL,9,Fscan, a public inquiry has been told.
OL,11,FThe inquiry was told Eljamel carried
OL,12,Fout almost 500 private procedures
OL,13,Fbetween 2002 and 2013 at Dundee's
OL,14,FFernbrae Hospital, in addition to his
OL,15,FNHS work.
OL,17,FEljamel, who is believed to have harmed
OL,18,Fhundreds of patients, was a consultant
OL,19,FNHS neurosurgeon at Ninewells Hospital
OL,20,Ffrom 1995 until his suspension in 2013.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
